# Generated by python -m ridge.deck_narrative --write. Scenario wording is
# rendered from assets/scenario-narrative-v1.json; do not retype it here.
pageType: content
audience: participant
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 40, 400, 16]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: PART 2 · HOW THE DAY WORKS}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 66, 832, 34]
    content: {style: "$title", fontSize: 30, wrap: false, text: "Four investigation phases, in order"}
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 116, 832, 2]
    viewBox: [832, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 832,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 136, 832, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 13
      text: |
        <p>The twenty tickets partition across four phases. A phase is a group of questions that answer each other; do not cherry-pick across them.</p>
  - elementId: phase1-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 170, 396, 168]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: phase1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 184, 368, 16]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", wrap: false, text: PHASE 1}
  - elementId: phase1-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [78, 208, 368, 2]
    viewBox: [368, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 368,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: phase1-tickets
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 220, 368, 16]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.tickets
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", text: T01 · T02 · T03}
  - elementId: phase1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 244, 368, 24]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.title
    content: {fontSize: 19, bold: true, color: "$slate", text: What actually left the network}
  - elementId: phase1-urgency
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 278, 368, 54]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.urgency
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p>High and bounded. Nothing downstream is worth doing until you can describe the transfer in one sentence that a stranger could check.</p>
  - elementId: phase2-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [500, 170, 396, 150]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: phase2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 184, 368, 16]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", wrap: false, text: PHASE 2}
  - elementId: phase2-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [514, 208, 368, 2]
    viewBox: [368, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 368,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: phase2-tickets
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 220, 368, 16]
    contractRef: phases.phase-2.tickets
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", text: T04 · T05 · T13 · T14 · T15 · T16 · T17 · T18}
  - elementId: phase2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 244, 368, 24]
    contractRef: phases.phase-2.title
    content: {fontSize: 19, bold: true, color: "$slate", text: The workstation that sent it}
  - elementId: phase2-urgency
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 278, 368, 36]
    contractRef: phases.phase-2.urgency
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p>Steady. This is the phase where teams either build a coherent account or collect isolated facts. Slow is fine; scattershot is not.</p>
  - elementId: phase3-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 338, 396, 168]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: phase3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 352, 368, 16]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", wrap: false, text: PHASE 3}
  - elementId: phase3-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [78, 376, 368, 2]
    viewBox: [368, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 368,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: phase3-tickets
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 388, 368, 16]
    contractRef: phases.phase-3.tickets
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", text: T06 · T07 · T10 · T11 · T12}
  - elementId: phase3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 412, 368, 24]
    contractRef: phases.phase-3.title
    content: {fontSize: 19, bold: true, color: "$slate", text: The account and its session}
  - elementId: phase3-urgency
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 446, 368, 54]
    contractRef: phases.phase-3.urgency
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p>This phase contains the most tempting wrong answer in the exercise. A reset was performed and it feels like a fix. Establishing that it was not is the real work.</p>
  - elementId: phase4-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [500, 338, 396, 168]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: phase4-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 352, 368, 16]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", wrap: false, text: PHASE 4}
  - elementId: phase4-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [514, 376, 368, 2]
    viewBox: [368, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 368,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: phase4-tickets
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 388, 368, 16]
    contractRef: phases.phase-4.tickets
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", text: T08 · T09 · T19 · T20}
  - elementId: phase4-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 412, 368, 24]
    contractRef: phases.phase-4.title
    content: {fontSize: 19, bold: true, color: "$slate", text: "The document, and the limit of the claim"}
  - elementId: phase4-urgency
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 446, 368, 36]
    contractRef: phases.phase-4.urgency
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p>Convergent. These tickets unlock late and deliberately depend on the earlier ones. Do not shortcut them.</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 505, 700, 15]
    content: {fontSize: 12, color: "#7E877F", wrap: false, text: OPERATION SILENT RIDGE — EXERCISE ONLY}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 505, 40, 15]
    content: {fontSize: 12, color: "#7E877F", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "7"}
